       <p> </p> 
       <p> </p> 
       <p style="background: white; margin: 4px 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: rgb(93, 93, 93); text-transform: none; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 2em; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px;"><strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: red;">特别提醒：</span></strong></span></p> 
       <p style="background: white; margin: 4px 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: rgb(93, 93, 93); text-transform: none; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 2em; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 18px;">1</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #555555; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 18px;">．</span><strong style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: red; font-size: 18px;">请报考人员及时维护更新在国家网报平台注册的手机号码，确保考试机构能够顺利联系到报考人员本人。</span></strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #555555; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 18px;">具体更新步骤：登录全国专业技术人员资格考试报名服务平台（http://zg.cpta.com.cn/examfront/login/initLogin.htm），点击右上方“注册维护”，选择“更换手机号码”，输入新手机号，获取验证码并输入，保存信息。</span></span></p> 
       <p style="background: white; margin: 4px 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: rgb(93, 93, 93); text-transform: none; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 2em; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #555555; font-size: 18px;">2．本项考试采用告知承诺制方式报名。考后考试机构将对各科成绩均预合格的考生进行报考资格审核。审查对象不符合报考条件的，按考试报名无效或者考试成绩无效处理。请报考人员切勿相信不法培训机构的虚假宣传。</span></p> 
       <p style="background: white; margin: 4px 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: rgb(93, 93, 93); text-transform: none; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 2em; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #555555; font-size: 18px;">3．报考人员有</span><strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: red; font-size: 18px;">提供虚假证明材料</span></strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #555555; font-size: 18px;">或者以其他不正当手段取得相应资格证书或者成绩证明等严重违纪违规行为的，由证书签发机构宣布证书或者成绩证明无效，并将其违纪违规行为记入专业技术人员资格考试诚信档案库，记录期限为五年。</span><strong><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: red; font-size: 18px;">考试机构将向社会公布考试诚信档案库记录相关信息，并通知当事人所在单位。</span></strong></span></p> 
       <p style="background: white; margin: 4px 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: rgb(93, 93, 93); text-transform: none; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 2em; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #555555; font-size: 18px;">4．国家未指定任何培训机构开展职业资格考试培训工作，报考人员要警惕不法培训机构所谓“保过”等招摇撞骗行为，谨防上当受骗。</span></p> 
       <p style="background: white; margin: 4px 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: rgb(93, 93, 93); text-transform: none; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 2em; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #555555; font-size: 18px;"><br></span></p> 
